                                "sense_id": "b82afdba-e93a-374b-8b01-3e87099938eb",
                                "text": "Once a term of homophobic abuse, the term “queer” has been reappropriated as a marker for some gay, lesbian, bisexual, transgender (GLBT), and other marginalized sexual identities."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76586caf-2ff3-4bfd-852b-4013b595a08f",
                                "sense_id": "b82afdba-e93a-374b-8b01-3e87099938eb",
                                "text": "The term 'People of the Book' has been reappropriated as a means of self-identification by Jews and by the members of certain Christian denominations."
                            }
                        ]
